// IncidentObligationStep ONE STEP OF A REPORT, its clock and its filing. "The clocks count hours of the calendar,
// never working days." A step that counts from an earlier one has no due moment until that one
// is filed (`fileIncidentObligationStep`), and then counts from the moment it was filed.
