// RiskScenarioVersionValue The version of the library this scenario is. A risk kept from it records this number
// (`Risk.from_scenario`).
type RiskScenarioVersionValue = RiskScenarioVersion

// RiskScore "A score is likelihood × impact": the two picks multiplied, so 1 to 9 on a 3×3 scale and 1 to
// 25 on a 5×5. Worked out on the scale in force each time the risk is read, and never kept.
