// TrustCenterAddress WHERE A STRANGER OPENS THE PUBLISHED PAGE — "one address, opened without an Onplo account".
// Twenty characters, minted at random when the page is first published and kept for ever
// after, so a link on the company's own website keeps working when the page is taken down and
// published again. Nothing about the company can be read from it.
