// TrustCenterAddressValue Where a stranger opens the published page; `null` until it is first published, and
// kept for ever after, taken down or not.
type TrustCenterAddressValue = TrustCenterAddress

// TrustCenterSection "Which proof to show publicly: certifications/badges, sub-processor list, security
// posture, documents on request." A closed list, so a client may switch on every value.
