//   - GDPR or UK GDPR, to the affected people: `notice`, reminded at 72 hours (Onplo's number).
//   - NIS2: `early_warning` within 24 hours and `incident_notification` within 72 hours, then
//     `final_report` within one month of the incident notification being filed.
//   - DORA: `initial_notification` within 4 hours and never later than 24 hours after the
//     incident was reported, then `intermediate_report` within 72 hours of the initial one
//     being filed, and `final_report` within one month of the intermediate one being filed.
//   - The CRA: `early_warning` within 24 hours and `incident_notification` within 72 hours. Then
