	// NEXT EDIT MAKES IT A DRAFT AGAIN." The note is required, and who refused is written from the
	// call's credential. The permission is signing's, `.approve`: the catalogue gives "sign an
	// assessment, or refuse it with a note" one row.
	//
	// Only one in review is refused: any other is `assessment_not_in_review`. A version approved
	// before stays approved and readable.
