	// "A SIGNER WHO REFUSES SENDS IT TO NEEDS REVISION WITH A NOTE SAYING WHY, AND THE STEWARD'S
	// NEXT EDIT MAKES IT A DRAFT AGAIN." The note is required, and who refused is written from the
