	// ListIncidentNoticeRecipients See whom a notice proposes to tell, and who of them is confirmed
	//
	// "THE APP PROPOSES RECIPIENTS FROM THE ADDRESSES ONPLO ALREADY HOLDS." For your customers,
	// "the people who subscribed on your Trust Center": each one today, the oldest first. For the
	// affected people, each address a file added (`addIncidentNoticeAddressFile`), in the order
	// they were added. Each says whether it is confirmed (`confirmIncidentNoticeRecipients`), and
	// who confirmed it when.
