	// GetLegalHold Read one legal hold
	//
	// One hold's record, as `listLegalHolds` answers it — in force or released.
	//
	// FOR A PERSON THE HOLD IS HIDDEN FROM, THERE IS NO HOLD. A Confidential hold answers them
	// `not_found` here, exactly as an id that names nothing does. So does a placement that was
	// never in force.
	//
	// Corresponds with GET /legal-holds/{legal_hold_id} (the `GetLegalHold` operationId).
