	// refused while the hold stood is not carried out by this. Whoever asked asks again" until
	// decision 0672: a hold refuses no delete, so there is nothing to ask again.)
	//
	// FOR A PERSON THE HOLD IS HIDDEN FROM, THERE IS NO HOLD TO RELEASE. A Confidential hold
	// answers them `not_found` here, exactly as an id that names nothing does.
