	// ListPolicies The policy library
	//
	// "SEE THE POLICY LIBRARY AND EACH VERSION'S STATE." One library per account environment.
	// A row is the policy and where its versions stand: the latest version's number and state,
	// and which version is published.
	//
	// THE POLICIES IN USE, UNLESS THE RETIRED ONES ARE ASKED FOR. "Retiring takes it out of the
	// library's current list … The record stays readable under Retired for the auditor"
	// (decision 0784, point 4). So `retired=true` answers the retired policies and nothing else,
	// as the vendor register does.
	//
