	// A RETIRED POLICY IS READ AND NOT CHANGED, and is refused with `policy_retired`.
	//
	// TAKING SOMEBODY OFF WHO MUST ACKNOWLEDGE CLOSES THEIR OPEN TASK (ONPLO-2412): nobody asks
	// them any more, so each task still open for a person no longer named is cancelled on the
	// platform's one task list, as retiring the policy cancels it, unless they are in a team still
	// named. Setting `acknowledgement` to
	// null takes everybody off. An acknowledgement they already gave stays on the record, and a
	// task they already finished stays finished. Somebody added is asked by the next version
