	//
	// "SIGN AN ACKNOWLEDGEMENT IN YOUR OWN NAME." The caller acknowledges the version that is
	// published now, and the acknowledgement names it. Who acknowledged is written from the
	// call's credential, never from the request, and never an agent: "an attestation is a dated
	// statement by a named person and is never inferred from activity".
