	//
	// AN ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT THAT HAS NEVER SET THEM READS WHERE IT STARTS — Critical 7 · High
	// 30 · Medium 90 · Low 180. Nothing here says which of the four were ever changed: the answer
	// is what every open finding's fix-by counts against now, and when a window moved is the
	// audit trail's to say.
