	// SEEING THEM IS A PERMISSION OF ITS OWN, and setting them does not carry it, "so a steward
	// can read the deadline their finding counts against without being able to move it". The
	// catalogue gained it with decision 0804, point 3. Every look is recorded (decision 0675), as
	// reading the check thresholds is.
