	// open before it counts as overdue — Critical 7 days · High 30 · Medium 90 · Low 180,
	// changeable per environment." Those four are what an account environment starts with.
	//
	// ALL FOUR, EVERY TIME. A PUT and not a PATCH: the four are one setting, and a caller that
	// changes one says the other three it means to keep. The answer is the four as they now
	// stand, and `getRemediationWindows` reads them. (This said a PUT "because seeing the windows
	// has no permission yet" until decision 0804 gave seeing them one.)
