// them: a caller that cannot read them cannot be asked to change one and trust the other
// eight. The answer is the nine as they now stand. (This said "seeing the thresholds has no
// permission yet" until `getCheckThresholds` was declared under the one the catalogue
// gained on 2026-10-09.) (It was
