// environment today may be named; any other id — no such team, another environment's, a team
// deleted, or any team at all in a personal account environment — is refused under the same
// `steward_not_found`, and `identity_unavailable` means the same as for a person.
//
// IT STARTS AT `not-started` WITH NO EVIDENCE. Where it stands is moved afterwards, by
// `setControlStatus` — see `Control.status`. (This said "nothing in this API moves the status
// yet" until that operation was served.)
//
// A CONTROL YOU WRITE IS AN ORDINARY LIBRARY ENTRY. Nothing about it differs because it was
// written instead of picked from Onplo's ready-made controls, and it takes evidence exactly
// as a picked one does. Its `picked_from` is `null`.
