// RetryEvidenceUploadWithBody Try a failed upload again
//
// A NEW ADDRESS FOR THE SAME UPLOAD, for a file that did not arrive or arrived another size.
// THE ADDRESS BEFORE IT STOPS WORKING, and completing with its `save_id` is the 404
// `evidence_upload_not_found`: an evidence file takes one save, so two can never land.
//
// ONCE A SAVE HAS LANDED IT IS REFUSED: `evidence_upload_already_saved`. Proof that changes
// after it was given is not proof. Call `completeEvidenceUpload` with the save that landed;
// a different file is a new upload.
//
// ANOTHER WRITE OF THIS FILE MAY HAVE BEGUN MEANWHILE. That is `storage_unavailable`, never a
// no: ask again. An upload that is not an evidence file of this account environment, or was
// removed, is `evidence_upload_not_found`.
