// ListIncidentNoticeAddressFileSkippedLines See each line of an address file that was skipped
//
// "THE LIST SHOWS HOW MANY WERE SKIPPED AND EACH SKIPPED LINE, SO A TYPO NEVER HOLDS UP A NOTICE
// THE LAW HAS A CLOCK ON." Each line `addIncidentNoticeAddressFile` skipped, in the order of the
