// computed. Ring 1, as placing is: a named person, never a raw key and never an agent.
//
// A POST AND NOT A DELETE, because the record does not go: a released hold stays as a
// released hold, with its matter, its reason and its authority. Placement and release are
// each an append-only event.
//
// ONCE. A hold already released is refused `legal_hold_already_released`, never released a
// second time under a second name.
//
// `freeze_unavailable` MEANS THE HOLD IS STILL IN FORCE. If the freeze could not be told,
// nothing changed, and the call is made again.
