	// AnswerAssessmentSectionWithBodyWithResponse Answer one section of an assessment
	//
	// "EACH TEMPLATE IS A FIXED LIST OF NAMED SECTIONS, AND EACH SECTION IS ANSWERED IN TEXT." One
	// section's answer, as it is to stand: `answer` `null` empties it. A section of the other
	// template is refused `section_not_on_template`.
