	// WHAT AN ANSWER DOES TO THE STATUS. A draft stays a draft. "The steward's next edit" of one
	// that needs revision "makes it a draft again". "Editing an approved assessment starts a new
	// draft. Until that draft is signed, the approved version stays readable and is still what an
	// audit export carries." One in review is refused `assessment_in_review`: what is signed is
	// what was sent, so it is taken back first.
