	// place, each one number with a stated default". An account environment starts at the
	// founder's defaults (decision 0722): a dormant account after 90 days, an invitation not
	// accepted after 14, unused access after 90, key rotation every 365, an unused key after 90,
	// training done within 30, a leaver's access gone within 1, and at most 5 administrators.
