	// you inside the app, and only the ones running against a legal clock also reach your email
	// and push". So all seven start with `in_app` on, and `compliance.breach-clock` and
	// `compliance.auditor-access` with `email` and `push` on as well.
	//
	// ACCOUNT'S GENERAL CHANNELS STILL DECIDE. An event with `email` on sends no email while
	// email is off in Account's Notification preferences; the choice here is kept and counts
	// again when the channel is back on.
