	// SetFrameworkScopeWithBodyWithResponse Limit a framework to a part of the company
	//
	// "A FRAMEWORK APPLIES TO ONE SCOPE OR TO THE WHOLE ENVIRONMENT, NEVER TO SEVERAL." This
	// limits it to one scope saved with `createScope`, or moves it from one scope to another,
	// "under the permission to change a framework, as the permission catalog already says".
	//
	// A SCOPE FILTERS, IT NEVER FORKS. The framework's Statement of Applicability names the
