	// names its audience, with the moment": the `notice` step of each obligation to that audience
	// that is still running and not filed is recorded as filed at that moment, by the sender, naming
	// the notice (`IncidentObligationFiling.sent_notice_id`). A bounce does not undo it. A correction
	// sent later files nothing more, because the step is filed already.
