	// WHO FILED IT is a member of this environment, named in the request, because the person who
	// submitted it in the authority's portal is not always the one recording it here. WHO RECORDED
	// IT AND WHEN are written from the call's own credential and the moment it arrives.
	//
	// THE RECEIPT IS A FILE ALREADY IN STORAGE, named by its id, as evidence is: what is kept is
	// the file's id and the save Storage calls current at this moment, never sent by the caller.
