	// each section's heading and text, in order.
	//
	// THE POLICY KEEPS WHICH TEMPLATE IT STARTED FROM, AND THAT TEMPLATE'S VERSION AND NAME, as a
	// picked control keeps its ready-made control. A newer version of the template never changes it.
	// Its title is the template's name unless you send one.
