	// that refusal where a second person exists to do the round": a round whose auditor is the
	// steward of a control it tests is refused 409 `auditor_stewards_a_tested_control`. "A single
	// person running the program alone is never blocked": where the auditor is the only person who
	// reaches Compliance in this account environment — a personal environment, a one-person
	// company, a company where only one person reaches this app — the round is planned, and
