	//
	// "PER TIER: REVIEW CADENCE, A QUESTIONNAIRE OR A CURRENT PUBLISHED REPORT REQUIRED OR NOT
	// (EITHER MEETS IT, FOR EVERY TIER), DPA REQUIRED OR NOT — set once, applied to every vendor
	// of that tier." An account environment starts where `getVendorAssessmentRules` says.
	//
	// ALL THREE TIERS, EVERY TIME. A PUT and not a PATCH, as the check thresholds are: the answer
	// is the three as they now stand.
	//
	// A SUB-PROCESSOR NEEDS A DPA WHATEVER ITS TIER. That is what the mark is for, so it is not a
	// rule here and no setting turns it off.
