	// `suggested_risk_tier`, and `risk_tier_set_by_hand` is never touched by it.
	//
	// EVERY ID IS AN ENTRY OF THIS REGISTER. One that names no entry of this account environment's
	// register, or one being deleted, is refused `register_entry_not_found`, and nothing is
	// written. One entry may be named by several vendors.
	//
	// A RETIRED VENDOR IS NOT CHANGED: `vendor_retired`, the rule `updateVendor` states.
	//
	// SENDING WHAT IS ALREADY SO CHANGES NOTHING and answers the vendor.
	//
	// Takes any type of body and a specified content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
