// RetryEvidenceUploadWithBodyWithResponse Try a failed upload again
//
// A NEW ADDRESS FOR THE SAME UPLOAD, for a file that did not arrive or arrived another size.
// THE ADDRESS BEFORE IT STOPS WORKING, and completing with its `save_id` is the 404
// `evidence_upload_not_found`: an evidence file takes one save, so two can never land.
