// UpdateEvidenceSourceWithBodyWithResponse Change an evidence source
//
// NAME OTHER CONTROLS, OR KEEP WHAT IT COLLECTS LONGER OR SHORTER. Every field optional, an
// omitted one untouched. `control_ids` replaces the whole list: the list sent is the list
// kept.
//
// "AN ITEM ALREADY COLLECTED KEEPS PROVING THE CONTROLS IT WAS COLLECTED FOR, and items
// collected after the change prove the new list." So changing the controls takes no proof
// from any control, and moves no status.
//
// "CHANGING THEM REACHES THE ITEMS COLLECTED AFTER THE CHANGE": a new keep or fresh window
// moves no date of an item already collected.
//
// A CONTROL NAMED THAT IS NOT IN THIS LIBRARY IS `control_not_found`, and nothing changes. A
// RETIRED CONTROL NEWLY NAMED IS `control_retired`, and nothing changes; one the source
// already names and that was retired since may stay on the list, as a retired control is
// read.
//
// ITS SCHEDULE IS NOT CHANGED HERE: only a manual source can be named yet, and a manual source
// has none (ONPLO-3860).
//
// SENDING WHAT IT ALREADY SAYS CHANGES NOTHING, and the source comes back as it stands.
//
// Takes any type of body and a specified content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
// Corresponds with PATCH /evidence-sources/{evidence_source_id} (the `UpdateEvidenceSource` operationId).
