// UpdateFrameworkWithBodyWithResponse Change when you aim to be ready, or who answers for it
//
// THE TARGET DATE AND THE STEWARD, each optional and an omitted one untouched. "When you aim
// to be ready — drives the plan and reminders": `null` takes the date away, since a framework
// need not have one.
//
// HANDED TO ANOTHER STEWARD, AS A CONTROL IS. "A framework is handed to another steward, as
// a control is. Under the permission to change a framework, and asked of a member of this
