// after the diff, and the mapping it replaces stays in the framework's history (decision
// 0783, point 7), and no operation reads a framework's requirements or its mapping yet; a
// scope can be saved and not yet named by a framework (ONPLO-2181). Each arrives as a field
// here, or an operation of its own, in a change of its own. (This said how a new version is
// taken is on no page until that decision.) (This said whether the permission also hands a
// framework to another steward was on no page, so it took no steward, until decision 0934 and
// the Frameworks page said it does, ONPLO-4090.)
