// report from that moment, as working the incident owes any other; the event names each
// obligation it added. A FIX OR MITIGATION BEING AVAILABLE is recorded here too, with its zone,
// and only on an exploited vulnerability: on any other is `422` at `/body/fix_available_at`, and
// so is a moment ahead of now or one sent without its zone; a zone no clock knows is `422` at
