// `ai_system_record_not_found`, and nothing changes. With the EU AI Act in scope, a system of
// tier `high` named and a case said, it owes the EU AI Act's report, as working the incident
// owes any other. A widespread infringement is ticked beside a case, never alone.
//
// A CLOSED INCIDENT IS READ AND NOT WORKED, and is refused with `incident_closed`: reopening
// it comes first.
