// number on the confirm can differ from what the release then lets go; the release's own
// answer, `ghosts_let_go_count`, says what went.
//
// A RELEASED HOLD KEEPS NONE, AND ANSWERS `0`. Its own number stays on its record as
// `ghosts_let_go_count`.
//
